  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIDE CAG - Sustainable Interventions for Development Enhancement Cooperative Agreemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the Partner cooperative agreement in Kenya. Funds are used to support staff salaries and benefits, program monitoring expenses, office and vehicle expenses, an annual audit, training, and other small administrative expenses. Funds disbursed to provide liquidity in light of unanticipated shocks impacting project activities and grantee enterprises due to the COVID-19 pandemic. Funds to assist with project needs in light of fund shortage due to COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
